1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,095
Meet Vouch:

2
00:00:01,095 --> 00:00:05,426
a secure hiring workspace, where AI does the reading, and people

3
00:00:05,426 --> 00:00:06,780
make every decision.

4
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:10,313
Sara, a recruiter, starts on her overview:

5
00:00:10,313 --> 00:00:15,069
ten CVs analysed, seven security findings flagged for review, and

6
00:00:15,069 --> 00:00:17,776
one pipeline from CV to conversation.

7
00:00:17,776 --> 00:00:20,190
Nobody is rejected automatically.

8
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:23,425
Each role has a weighted scorecard.

9
00:00:23,425 --> 00:00:27,395
Vouch extracts evidence from every CV, and highlights the exact

10
00:00:27,395 --> 00:00:31,679
quote on the original page, so every score can be traced back to its

11
00:00:31,679 --> 00:00:32,120
source.

12
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:37,594
Candidates stay pseudonymous until the shortlist is confirmed.

13
00:00:37,594 --> 00:00:41,526
Hidden instructions and keyword stuffing are flagged as findings for

14
00:00:41,526 --> 00:00:44,590
a person to review, instead of being silently scored.

15
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:49,976
The AI Inbox previews how candidate messages will be grouped,

16
00:00:49,976 --> 00:00:51,761
summarised, and answered.

17
00:00:51,761 --> 00:00:56,546
In this demo, the messages are synthetic samples, and no mailbox is

18
00:00:56,546 --> 00:00:57,260
connected.

19
00:00:58,290 --> 00:01:01,943
Interviews and internal meetings share one calendar.

20
00:01:01,943 --> 00:01:05,035
For each interview, Vouch suggests a format:

21
00:01:05,035 --> 00:01:09,812
an AI chat first round, a recruiter, or senior HR, and explains why.

22
00:01:09,812 --> 00:01:11,850
The recruiter makes the call.

23
00:01:13,730 --> 00:01:16,008
Follow-ups keep the team on track:

24
00:01:16,008 --> 00:01:20,362
confirming interviews, collecting feedback, and reviewing flagged

25
00:01:20,362 --> 00:01:20,630
CVs.

26
00:01:20,630 --> 00:01:23,510
A reminder never sends anything on its own.

27
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:26,887
Nothing reaches a candidate without approval.

28
00:01:26,887 --> 00:01:30,740
The hiring manager approves the exact message and its fingerprint.

29
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:34,360
Change a single character, and the approval no longer matches.

30
00:01:35,820 --> 00:01:39,830
Every approval, edit, and refusal is written to an append-only

31
00:01:39,830 --> 00:01:40,283
ledger.

32
00:01:40,283 --> 00:01:44,422
Each event is linked to the one before it by a hash, so the full

33
00:01:44,422 --> 00:01:45,780
trail can be checked.

34
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:51,224
In its latest recorded run, Vouch passed all 24 of its attack

35
00:01:51,224 --> 00:01:51,995
scenarios.

36
00:01:51,995 --> 00:01:54,000
Tested, not just promised.

37
00:01:54,740 --> 00:01:55,290
Vouch.

38
00:01:55,290 --> 00:01:57,399
Evidence you can trace.

39
00:01:57,399 --> 00:01:59,050
People in control.

